# "Return all attacking creatures to their owner's hand.": "there's no such thing as an attacking creature outside of the
# combat phase". Bot1's Ornithopter attacks on turn 3, but Bot2 casts Aetherize only in Bot1's second main phase, when
# nothing is attacking, so nothing returns (the Ornithopter that attacked, the one that stayed home and Bot2's own all
# stay). A control: the first scenario shows the same card returning attackers during the declare attackers step.

